-    """Encode [B,F,C,H,W] frames to [B,F,C_lat,H/8,W/8] scaled latents."""
+    """Encode [B,F,C,H,W] frames to [B,F,C_lat,H/8,W/8] scaled latents.
+
+    If `frames` already has non-3 channels it's assumed to be pre-computed
+    VAE latents (see TartanDriveDataSource with use_cached_latents=True) —
+    pass through unchanged.
+    """
